  "subview": true,
  "back_path": "/lovelace/heating-overview-detail",
  "header": {
    "layout": "start",
    "badges_position": "bottom",
    "badges_wrap": "scroll",
    "card": {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text_only": true,
      "content": "# Podrobnosti kotle\nProvoz, třícestný ventil, servisní údaje a spotřeba"
    }
  },
  "type": "sections",
  "max_columns": 2,
  "dense_section_placement": false,
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "column_span": 2,
      "background": {
        "color": "#35505d",
        "opacity": 0.055
      },
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Stav kotle",
          "icon": "mdi:water-boiler",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "condition": "or",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "sensor.system_bus_status",
                  "state_not": "connected"
                },
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "sensor.boiler_curflowtemp",
                  "state": [
                    "unavailable",
                    "unknown"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "condition": "state",
                  "entity": "sensor.boiler_servicecodenumber",
                  "state": [
                    "unavailable",
                    "unknown"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "card": {
            "type": "markdown",
            "content": "**Údaje kotle nejsou kompletně dostupné.**\n\nZkontroluj spojení EMS a dostupnost čidel. V testu hlavic nepokračuj, dokud nejsou údaje znovu dostupné.",
            "card_mod": {
              "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.20);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,118,110,.055),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "**Aktuální stav kotle**\n\n{{ states('sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_aktualni_stav_s_popisem') if has_value('sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_aktualni_stav_s_popisem') else 'Údaj z kotle není dostupný.' }}\n\n**Poslední uložená porucha · historie**\n\n{{ states('sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_posledni_porucha_s_popisem') if has_value('sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_posledni_porucha_s_popisem') else 'Historie poruch není dostupná.' }}\n\n<small>Uložená porucha sama o sobě neznamená, že právě trvá. [Význam kódů Bosch](https://junkers-cz-cs-c.boschhc-documents.com/download/pdf/file/6720889912#page=47)</small>",
          "entity_id": [
            "sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_aktualni_stav_s_popisem",
            "sensor.ems_esp_boiler_kotel_posledni_porucha_s_popisem"
          ],
          "card_mod": {
            "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.18);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(37,99,235,.045),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
          },
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "custom:mushroom-chips-card",
          "alignment": "justify",
          "chips": [
            {
              "type": "template",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.boiler_heatingactive",
              "icon": "mdi:radiator",
              "content": "{% if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingactive','on') %}Vytápění: běží{% elif is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingactive','off') %}Vytápění: stojí{% else %}Vytápění: stav neověřen{% endif %}",
              "icon_color": "{{ 'amber' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingactive','on') else 'grey' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingactive','off') else 'red' }}"
            },
            {
              "type": "template",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.boiler_burngas",
              "icon": "mdi:gas-burner",
              "content": "{% if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_burngas','on') %}Hořák: běží{% elif is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_burngas','off') %}Hořák: stojí{% else %}Hořák: stav neověřen{% endif %}",
              "icon_color": "{{ 'amber' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_burngas','on') else 'grey' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_burngas','off') else 'red' }}"
            },
            {
              "type": "template",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.boiler_heatingpump",
              "icon": "mdi:pump",
              "content": "{% if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingpump','on') %}Čerpadlo: běží{% elif is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingpump','off') %}Čerpadlo: stojí{% else %}Čerpadlo: stav neověřen{% endif %}",
              "icon_color": "{{ 'amber' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingpump','on') else 'grey' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_heatingpump','off') else 'red' }}"
            },
            {
              "type": "template",
              "entity": "binary_sensor.boiler_tapwateractive",
              "icon": "mdi:water-thermometer",
              "content": "{% if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_tapwateractive','on') %}Režim TUV dle EMS: aktivní{% elif is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_tapwateractive','off') %}Režim TUV dle EMS: neaktivní{% else %}Režim TUV dle EMS: neověřen{% endif %}",
              "icon_color": "{{ 'amber' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_tapwateractive','on') else 'grey' if is_state('binary_sensor.boiler_tapwateractive','off') else 'red' }}"
            },
            {
              "type": "template",
              "entity": "sensor.system_bus_status",
              "icon": "mdi:lan",
              "content": "BUS: {{ states('sensor.system_bus_status') }}\n",
              "icon_color": "{{ 'green' if is_state('sensor.system_bus_status','connected') else 'red' }}\n"
            },
            {
              "type": "entity",
              "entity": "sensor.boiler_curflowtemp",
              "name": "°C",
              "icon": "mdi:thermometer-water"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "square": false,
          "columns": 3,
          "cards": [
            {
              "type": "gauge",
              "name": "Teplota vody",
              "entity": "sensor.boiler_curflowtemp",
              "min": 20,
              "max": 90,
              "card_mod": {
                "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.20);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,118,110,.055),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "gauge",
              "name": "Výkon hořáku",
              "entity": "sensor.boiler_absburnpow",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "card_mod": {
                "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.20);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,118,110,.055),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "gauge",
              "name": "Modulace čerpadla",
              "entity": "sensor.boiler_heatingpumpmod",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 100,
              "card_mod": {
                "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.20);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(15,118,110,.055),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
