      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "TUV a třícestný ventil",
          "icon": "mdi:valve",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "{% set vent = 'binary_sensor.boiler_ww3wayvalve' %}\n{% set ready = is_state('sensor.system_bus_status', 'connected') %}\n{% set position = states(vent) %}\n{% if ready and position in ['on', 'off'] %}\n### {{ 'Hlášená poloha TUV' if position == 'on' else 'Hlášená poloha vytápění' }}\nPoslední změna hlášeného stavu **{{ as_local(states.binary_sensor.boiler_ww3wayvalve.last_changed).strftime('%d. %m. %Y v %H:%M:%S') }}**\n{% else %}\n### Poloha ventilu nedostupná\nČeká se na platný údaj z EMS.\n{% endif %}\n\n<small>EMS hlásí stav řízení ventilu. V této instalaci kotel slouží k vytápění prostor.</small>",
          "entity_id": [
            "binary_sensor.boiler_ww3wayvalve",
            "sensor.system_bus_status"
          ],
          "card_mod": {
            "style": {
              ".": "ha-card {border-radius:18px;border:1px solid rgba(15,118,110,.22);background:linear-gradient(130deg,rgba(15,118,110,.085),transparent 80%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);} ha-markdown {padding:11px 14px !important;}",
              "ha-markdown$": "h2 {font-size:20px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.3px;margin:0 0 4px;} p {font-size:12.8px;line-height:1.28;margin:0;} small {font-size:11px;color:var(--secondary-text-color);} a {color:var(--primary-text-color);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;}"
            }
          },
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "title": "Živý stav TUV · EMS",
          "content": "{% set ready = is_state('sensor.system_bus_status', 'connected') %}\n{% macro flag(id) -%}\n{{ 'Ano' if ready and is_state(id, 'on') else 'Ne' if ready and is_state(id, 'off') else '—' }}\n{%- endmacro %}\n{% macro temp(id) -%}\n{{ states(id) ~ ' °C' if ready and is_number(states(id)) else '—' }}\n{%- endmacro %}\n{% set mode = states('select.boiler_wwcomfort1') %}\n| Údaj | Hodnota |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Ohřev TUV povolený | **{{ flag('switch.boiler_wwactivated') }}** |\n| Uložená teplota TUV | {{ temp('number.boiler_wwseltemp') }} |\n| Režim přípravy TUV | {{ 'ECO' if ready and mode in ['eco', 'eko'] else mode if ready and has_value('select.boiler_wwcomfort1') else '—' }} |\n| `1-b7` · Aktuální požadavek TUV | **{{ temp('sensor.boiler_wwsettemp') }}** |\n| Dezinfekce hlášená EMS | {{ flag('switch.boiler_wwdisinfecting') }} |",
          "entity_id": [
            "switch.boiler_wwactivated",
            "number.boiler_wwseltemp",
            "select.boiler_wwcomfort1",
            "sensor.boiler_wwsettemp",
            "switch.boiler_wwdisinfecting",
            "sensor.system_bus_status"
          ],
          "card_mod": {
            "style": "ha-card{border-radius:20px;border:1px solid rgba(37,99,235,.18);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(37,99,235,.045),transparent 74%),var(--ha-card-background,var(--card-background-color));box-shadow:0 8px 20px -18px rgba(15,23,42,.38),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);}"
          },
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "history-graph",
          "title": "Ventil, hořák a relé · posledních 12 hodin",
          "hours_to_show": 12,
          "entities": [
            {
              "entity": "binary_sensor.boiler_ww3wayvalve",
              "name": "Ventil v poloze TUV · EMS"
